          MvPolynomial.C c + ∑ j, MvPolynomial.C (v j) * MvPolynomial.X (Sum.inr j)
@CryptoResearch.FallDegree.BinaryLocalization.refutation_of_supported_affine_no_field_solution : ∀ {β : Type u_1}
